<title>HONG KONG: Deutche Morgan Grenfell names HK securities chief.</title>
<headline>Deutche Morgan Grenfell names HK securities chief.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutche Morgan Grenfell said on Tuesday it appointed Alex Yeung managing director of Deutsche Morgan Grenfell Securities Hong Kong, responsible for developing and marketing the Hong Kong/China equity product.</p>
<p>Yeung, previously managing director and deputy chairman of SBC Asia of SBC Warburg, would supervise all Deutche Morgan Grenfell's business based in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>Deutche Morgan Grenfell is the investment banking arm of Deutsche Bank.</p>
<p>-- HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 2843 6369</p>
